{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help support the game's development by purchasing this DLC skin pack.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927470/extras/b2bcb2333c8c473f36cae70362875d62.avif?t=1756750352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s Punkie Night Tonight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new version of Blade, never seen before! This crossover skin celebrates the collaboration between October Games and Full Moon Features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes a new skin and execution for Blade, straight from the twisted world of <i>Horror Legends</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Content:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the blood-soaked cornfields of Hudson Meadows comes a killer new look for the Puppet Master's most iconic Legend. This crossover DLC introduces a gritty, Halloween-horror redesign of Blade, inspired by October Games\u2019 monstrous slasher, <i>Punkie</i>! Equipped with a custom Scythe and Hook, plus a brand-new <strong>execution</strong>, this version of Blade isn't just a killer, he\u2019s a Monster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punkie Blade Skin for Blade</strong> : A punk-horror style skin featuring a stitched leather trench coat, neon steel blades, and glowing green eyes.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive Execution Animation</strong> : Watch Blade deliver a savage, cinematic finisher. This execution is unique to the crossover skin and can only be unlocked with this DLC. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brand-New Weapon: Scythe</strong> : Comes with <strong>7 unlockable weapon skins</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jack-O'-Lantern Emote</strong> : Spawn singing jack-o'-lanterns at will! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Maniacal laugh Voice Over.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927470?t=1756750352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927470?t=1756750352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927470/467999562dc9340578089926e2097abe5016caa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756750352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927470/467999562dc9340578089926e2097abe5016caa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756750352","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"You can Execute Human Characters as the Puppets Characters."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help support the game's development by purchasing this DLC skin pack.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927470/extras/b2bcb2333c8c473f36cae70362875d62.avif?t=1756750352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s Punkie Night Tonight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new version of Blade, never seen before! This crossover skin celebrates the collaboration between October Games and Full Moon Feature